{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T17:02:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036126542896746909"],"id":"2036126542896746909","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":8740,"like_count":49,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":3},"text":"以前他写给我的信 https://t.co/3QddaAkJVJ","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036126542896746909"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T16:56:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036124999870980348"],"id":"2036124999870980348","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2559,"like_count":52,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":7},"text":"好想找到一条不会坍塌的道路后就这样侥幸地幸福下去","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036124999870980348"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T16:15:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036114518376620136"],"id":"2036114518376620136","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2440,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":6},"text":"幸福都是马赛克 痛苦才是高清的","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036114518376620136"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T16:08:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036112800347718004"],"id":"2036112800347718004","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":22315,"like_count":391,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":57},"text":"其实那天我真的很想留住你，可是你说了很重的话落在我太轻的年纪总会砸坏点什么 比如我的自尊心 我的勇气和我的不舍","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036112800347718004"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T16:04:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036111778422333694"],"id":"2036111778422333694","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":13055,"like_count":358,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":73},"text":"我需要拥抱，拥抱，紧紧握住我的手，告诉我一切都是安全的，没有任何人会伤害我，会爱我吗？说会永远爱我吧，说会永远保护我吧，拜托，拜托了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036111778422333694"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T15:12:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036098823202939328"],"id":"2036098823202939328","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":46751,"like_count":638,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":149},"text":"哭其实有用，没用的是我","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036098823202939328"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T15:10:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036098365042356373"],"id":"2036098365042356373","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1729,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"以前胖胖的时候很喜欢吃东西，减肥以来也发现除了基因决定的那部分，身材呈现方式都和自己的决定有关。我喜欢美味蹭过鼻子底端时，唾液充斥口腔的感觉。现在说来还是会不好意思，感觉像小狗一样。但是瘦下来之后反而喜欢上这种渴望。有人说食欲的爆发是情感的匮乏体现。真希望明天不要到来。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036098365042356373"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T13:16:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036069647657922644"],"id":"2036069647657922644","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3325,"like_count":52,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我不仅会因为哄不好别人感到焦虑，我还会因为别人哄不好我感到焦虑","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036069647657922644"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T12:42:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036061084596265068"],"id":"2036061084596265068","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":83,"impression_count":86717,"like_count":1478,"quote_count":36,"reply_count":36,"retweet_count":161},"text":"最恶心的就是“祝你幸福。”这句话，这就好像一个贼跑到你的家里把你所有值钱的不值钱的东西全带走了，然后留下一张纸条，纸条上写着“恭喜发财”","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036061084596265068"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T08:49:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2036002346812190965"],"id":"2036002346812190965","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":5185,"like_count":94,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":7},"text":"你就这样因为对方的一句话或是一个笑颜而付出了自己的一生","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2036002346812190965"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T05:17:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035949154577654236"],"id":"2035949154577654236","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":5917,"like_count":47,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我想知道你身上的伤疤是哪来的，每道疤痕后面的故事是什么，身下的疤痕不用你讲，我自己会摸","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035949154577654236"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-23T05:09:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035947080360083817"],"id":"2035947080360083817","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":33340,"like_count":699,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":74},"text":"老己，我已经没钱哄你高兴了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035947080360083817"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T17:08:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035765486026432523"],"id":"2035765486026432523","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":8702,"like_count":190,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":17},"text":"人和人的缘分一闪而过像误触刷新的推荐页","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035765486026432523"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T17:04:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035764572578340964"],"id":"2035764572578340964","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":12791,"like_count":258,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":59},"text":"幸福要是像焦虑一样随时随地降临在我身边就好了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035764572578340964"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T16:53:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035761715565277490"],"id":"2035761715565277490","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6294,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"让我感到冒犯 https://t.co/KRiiMjrYl4","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035761715565277490"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T14:38:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035727818689323407"],"id":"2035727818689323407","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":21371,"like_count":202,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":29},"text":"不理我的时候我就感觉我像叼着玩具被关在门外的狗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035727818689323407"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T14:13:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035721512259596677"],"id":"2035721512259596677","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":72,"impression_count":115925,"like_count":1263,"quote_count":15,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":108},"text":"你长大了，两个世界都有了你爱的人。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035721512259596677"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T14:12:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035721405506200059"],"id":"2035721405506200059","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2388,"like_count":19,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"看不到未来其实是看到了未来","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035721405506200059"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T13:59:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035718131184968013"],"id":"2035718131184968013","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1758,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我小小的脑子里总是会想一些小小的事情，但是想又想不明白说又说不明白，然后就只是变成了一声唉","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035718131184968013"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T13:58:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035717741982994940"],"id":"2035717741982994940","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":10553,"like_count":182,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":19},"text":"那个时候我过度依赖你所暴露出来的孩子气，其实你从来都没有觉得可爱过对吧","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2035717741982994940"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-03-22T10:11:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2035660556737323360"],"id":"2035660556737323360","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2267,"like_count":13,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},